Changes to github.com/yzhou216/flake under test, as a diff against
1dd2043, under the terms of that repository:

  d2da2d9 darwin: accept the module arguments in iris
  ea5bce8 shell: test the host platform for darwin
  b466b5b flake: define the darwin systems with one function
  a26877d darwin_setup: read and pass the password verbatim
  ead3056 darwin_setup: switch to the iris configuration as root
  840a81c shell: enable tmux on every system
  435aa72 flake: stop binding the homebrew taps in the outputs
  2915a9f darwin: take no module arguments in the state version
  c3c7207 flake: fetch nix-darwin and nix-homebrew from their current owners

